    "body": "Merge-time refresh attempted, nothing pushed. The text conflicts in assets/posts/carvera.cps (manifest: both sides added lines, workOffsetIndex/workOffsetMax and coolantModes) and assets/posts/AGENTS.md (manifest paragraph: serves from main, workOffset text from this PR) are mechanical and keep both sides. But the merged tree fails the targeted gate for a logic reason: main added recorded streams crates/post/tests/recorded/streams/css_then_live.cnc and live_then_stop.cnc, which still carry 'PARAM WorkOffset G54', while this PR's generator now writes 'PARAM WorkOffset 1.000000' (recorded_streams: css_then_live_stream_is_current and live_then_stop_stream_is_current are stale). Also main added assets/posts/grblhal.cps and tinyg.cps, which do not set workOffsetIndex (they take the legacy G54..G59 word path; the decision file and assets/posts/AGENTS.md say every shipped post sets it, and work_offset_index.rs does not list them). The author should merge main, update those two goldens with the PR's other streams and re-read the script goldens they feed, and decide on the two new posts.",
